# Active Directory Home Lab (Help Desk Focus)

## Objective
Build and operate a small Active Directory environment to practice real world Tier 1 / Tier 2 help desk tasks, including user account management, DNS troubleshooting, and domain-joined workstation support.

---

## Environment
- Hypervisor: Oracle VirtualBox
- Server:
  - Windows Server 2022 (Desktop Experience)
  - Hostname: DC1
- Client:
  - Windows 11 Pro
  - Hostname: PC1
- Network:
  - VirtualBox Host-Only Adapter
  - Static IP addressing
- Domain:
  - corp.local

---

## Lab Architecture
- DC01
  - Active Directory Domain Services
  - DNS Server
  - Static IP: 192.168.100.10
- PC01
  - Domain-joined Windows 11 workstation
  - Static IP: 192.168.100.20
  - DNS points to DC01

